{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OeUI0JdXZM1794650150.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名7歲男童懷疑被外傭掌摑，警方以涉嫌虐兒拘捕37歲外傭。</p><p></p><p>警方上午近9時接獲男童的母親報案，指懷疑外傭在觀塘協和街家中掌摑男童的面。警員到場，以涉嫌對所看管兒童或少年人虐待或忽略，將該名外傭拘捕。</p><p></p><p>男童報稱鼻痛，清醒送往聯合醫院接受檢查。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:43:43.912975+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:57:09.237504+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:37:00.038181+00:00","content_hash":"300b64fa66dd8b5f80219cd9693a76f970c44ca3f97285abe7e2e9566a8bc64a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:43:43.912975+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}